      "writtenOn": "2017-05-15T19:29:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "rspangler@ might know, but my guess is that we might want to try reposting an interrupt. Looking briefly at the LPC implementation, it looks like we could make a SCI pulse for every event (even if one\u0027s already pending...)\n\nSure, for MKBP where we\u0027re notifying with a single GPIO, setting a GPIO high that\u0027s already high doesn\u0027t do much.",
      "parentUuid": "a71150c9_8c1b81d6",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 54,
        "startChar": 0,
